# Supabase Configuration
# Get these values from your Supabase project dashboard: Settings > API
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=your-publishable-key-here

# Setup Instructions:
# 1. Replace the values above with your Supabase project credentials
# 2. Run the schema against your Supabase database:
#    - Open supabase/final_schema.sql in Supabase SQL Editor and run it
# 3. Start the app: pnpm dev
